{"id":214,"title":"小测验","summary":"做这个简短的测验来测试你对Python中类的理解。","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Quiz","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f0f92746000011ecad953af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","title_html":"","render_mode":"slide","questions":[{"question_id":105,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"类主要有哪两部分组成？","question_text_html":"<p>类主要有哪两部分组成？</p>\n","question_options":[{"text":"方法和初始化函数","text_html":"<p>方法和初始化函数</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"方法和访问修饰符","text_html":"<p>方法和访问修饰符</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"方法和属性","text_html":"<p>方法和属性</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":true},{"text":"以上都不是","text_html":"<p>以上都不是</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false}]},{"question_id":106,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"以下代码的输出是什么？\n\n``` python\nclass MyClass:\n    def __init__(self, x, y):\n        self.x = y\n        self.y = x\n\n\nobj1 = MyClass(2, 5)\nprint('x =', obj1.x)\nprint('y =', obj1.y)\n\n```","question_text_html":"<p>以下代码的输出是什么？</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">class MyClass:\n    def __init__(self, x, y):\n        self.x = y\n        self.y = x\n\n\nobj1 = MyClass(2, 5)\nprint('x =', obj1.x)\nprint('y =', obj1.y)\n\n</code></pre>\n","question_options":[{"text":"x = 0\n\ny = 0\n","text_html":"<p>x = 0</p>\n<p>y = 0</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"x = 2\n\ny = 5\n","text_html":"<p>x = 2</p>\n<p>y = 5</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"x = 5\n\ny = 2\n","text_html":"<p>x = 5</p>\n<p>y = 2</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"初始化函数中赋值，注意x、y是互换的","md_html":"<p>初始化函数中赋值，注意x、y是互换的</p>\n"},"correct":true},{"text":"运行错误","text_html":"<p>运行错误</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false}]},{"question_id":107,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"Python类中的方法和属性默认是公开的。","question_text_html":"<p>Python